  "body": "We allow anchors in the default configuration and only restrict javascript: URLs. data: URLs (especially inside an iframe) might look like XSS: https://x.com/KwanAleister/status/1985542748930523233\n\nPersonally I don't think data: URLs are special here, you could also link to a HTTP page that shows an alert. I filed this issue mainly for tracking.",
